  "tha-ap488:1.1": "Nibbute lokanāthamhi ",
  "tha-ap488:1.2": "Siddhatthe lokanāyake / ",
  "tha-ap488:1.3": "mama ñātī samānetvā ",
  "tha-ap488:1.4": "dhātupūjaṃ akās' ahaṃ // // Catunavute ",
  "tha-ap488:2.1": "ito kappe ",
  "tha-ap488:2.2": "yaṃ dhātuṃ abhipūjayiṃ / ",
  "tha-ap488:2.3": "duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi ",
  "tha-ap488:2.4": "dhātupūjāy' idaṃ phalaṃ. // // ",
